---
layout: base
title: 技术笔记
description: 锂电池制造工艺技术笔记。涂布、辊压、干燥、化成等工序的工艺原理与实践经验。
permalink: /notes/
---

<div class="notes-list">
  <h1 class="name">技术笔记</h1>
  <p class="tagline" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">电池制造工艺笔记。工艺原理、问题分析、工程实践。</p>

  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <article class="note-card">
    <time class="note-date" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <h3 class="note-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
    {% if post.data.tags %}
      <div style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
          <span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
